    "field_name": "Command Execution Details and Purpose",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compile and run bin/hip-stream once over yaml array_size and num_iterations, parse Copy/Mul/Add/Triad/Dot bandwidth, and attach peak_percent = bandwidth/53, to measure HBM bandwidth. runtime_ms is hardcoded 1.0"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Methodology",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compile and run bin/hip-stream once over yaml array_size and num_iterations, parse Copy, Mul, Add, Triad, and Dot bandwidth, and set peak_percent to bandwidth/53. runtime_ms is hardcoded 1.0"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Execution Description With Parameters",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Builds and runs custom bin/hip-stream (BabelStream-style HIP kernels). array_size, num_iterations, and device_id are forwarded. peak_percent is bandwidth/53. runtime_ms is hardcoded 1.0. output_format: csv"
  },
